---
/*
 * "En esta página", the right rail, the third column of the docs layout.
 *
 * The list is EMPTY here and filled client-side (scripts/toc.ts). These pages are .astro, not
 * markdown, so Astro has no build-time `headings` collection to read, the headings only exist in the
 * rendered document. The rail stays hidden until the script marks it ready, so a page with nothing to
 * index (or a visitor with no JS) sees no empty shell.
 */
---

<aside class="docs-toc" data-docs-toc>
  <nav class="docs-toc__inner" aria-labelledby="docs-toc-title">
    <h2 class="docs-toc__title" id="docs-toc-title">En esta página</h2>
    <ul class="docs-toc__list"></ul>
  </nav>
</aside>
